肝！一代人有一代人的黄曲霉素？</title><description>根据世卫组织的数据，2022年肝癌新发病例87万左右，死亡76万例，亚洲新发病例与死亡病例均占全球的70%，是世界上负担最重的地区。到2040年，这两个数字预计将分别达到140万和130万。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=115688920318997&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/00678c14d1359bd2ebc6e00b5defa3544e39afb4.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1DU2DByEhp</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1DU2DByEhp</guid><pubDate>Tue, 09 Dec 2025 11:15:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>鼻炎：患者崩溃了！药企赚麻了？</title><description>&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=115660331944841&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/1ecce6ee04b8bd4d91544b718879adb52369b276.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1tP2vB8EUs</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1tP2vB8EUs</guid><pubDate>Thu, 04 Dec 2025 11:15:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>起初，人们以为这只是一场普通的流感...【甲流】</title><description>-&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=115608758780343&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/1a43e51171fb2784d7f2663a61bdcfbcaf75f587.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1FKUDBwEUd</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1FKUDBwEUd</guid><pubDate>Tue, 25 Nov 2025 11:15:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>起初，人们以为这只是一种普通的皮肤病...【湿疹】</title><description>&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=115591344031557&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/7617bb9f472d8f91943be516157ec62d7e83c981.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1M9UJBZEQg</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1M9UJBZEQg</guid><pubDate>Sat, 22 Nov 2025 11:15:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>别傻了，世上没有聪明药！麻黄碱、苯丙胺与专注达【药不能停3】</title><description>研究表明，哌甲酯仅对存在注意力缺陷的患者有效，能够恢复神经递质平衡，但健康人体内该系统本身并未失衡，这些药物不会提高智力或学习能力，顶多让人更加清醒专注，类似于喝了大量浓咖啡，超出治疗剂量使用反而会产生失眠、记忆力下降等一系列副作用。苯丙胺类药物也是同样道理，对普通人来说跟高度成瘾性和各种不良反应相比，所谓的“变聪明”疗效基本可以忽略不计。哪怕是安全性相对更高的莫达非尼，也是在改善注意力的基础上提升执行力，而非智力。家人们，真正意义上的“聪明药”是不存在的，任何时候都不要把希望寄托在这些药物上，不然就真的&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=115547018693735&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/d9e7e45d3b5fd4c3eff5c5923ecba659dc1fa924.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1USCTB5EK9</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1USCTB5EK9</guid><pubDate>Fri, 14 Nov 2025 11:15:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>不是所有的过敏都叫过敏！为什么过敏的人越来越多了？</title><description>-&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=115469793168451&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/680f3bc4c34e6020b7dffc5bea8e25e16ae859e0.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1zm1uB3EBz</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1zm1uB3EBz</guid><pubDate>Sat, 01 Nov 2025 11:15:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>合理摸鱼，有益健康和工作？</title><description>职场不能没有摸鱼，就像西方不能没有耶路撒冷&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=115399949615785&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/de931a172b60881f89a52387e5210547660ed107.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1hbswzBEdd</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1hbswzBEdd</guid><pubDate>Sun, 19 Oct 2025 11:30:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>这不是上头，是下头！一口气把酒精的危害讲清楚</title><description>总之，目前的主流说法几乎一致认为，酒精的安全剂量为0，不过咱也不用太激进，这个结论确实不代表你一滴酒都不能喝。换句话说，安全剂量为0的东西实在太多了，我们必须承认，熬夜的“安全剂量”，抽烟的“安全剂量”同样是0，但在权衡了安全剂量且当某种东西给生活质量的提升大于最低潜在危害时，必须要考虑到这个0是否在生活中具备可执行的指导意义。对不管爱不爱喝酒的人来说，他们应该都知道这个安全剂量为0，更重要的是应该尽可能的把这个安全剂量控制住且千万不要酗酒。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=115388188724233&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/b4c3806e0e7f3200db91f63e78dac0d5e0b7d925.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1CSWCz3Erv</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1CSWCz3Erv</guid><pubDate>Fri, 17 Oct 2025 11:30:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>辣椒：可能是最反差的食物？这不是味觉，是痛觉！但它也能保护你</title><description>21世纪的今天，我们几乎忘了，辣椒最开始只是不想被人类吃掉才进化出咄咄逼人的辛辣味道，但很明显，它低估了人类对吃的探索欲。辣椒将自己鲜明的特色赋予给全球各地的美食，颠覆了很多地区的饮食结构，掀起了长达几个世纪的嗜辣热潮。这是否也意味着，它反过来征服了人类呢？&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=115347990514305&amp;amp;high_quality=1&amp;amp;autoplay=0" width="650" height="477" scrolling="no" border="0" frameborder="no" framespacing="0" allowfullscreen="true" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/b6e7ef6d2657202b5fa050ad7767b4775a7d7a84.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1js4EzAE5d</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1js4EzAE5d</guid><pubDate>Fri, 10 Oct 2025 04:33:48 GMT</pubDate></item></channel></rss>